# RUN: llc -mtriple=aie2ps --start-before=postmisched -verify-machineinstrs \
# RUN:     -debug-only=sched-blocks -o /dev/null %s 2>&1 \
# RUN:   | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=DBG
# RUN: llc -mtriple=aie2ps --start-before=postmisched -verify-machineinstrs \
# RUN:     --stop-after=postmisched -o - %s 2>/dev/null \
# RUN:   | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=MIR
# REQUIRES: asserts
#
# Test sibling loop optimization: full merge of all matching bundles.
#
# Generated from gemm_int8_outerloop_pipelined_out_mode_1.ll with:
#   llc -mtriple=aie2ps -O2 -stop-before=postmisched
#
# OLP structure (bb numbers after OLP transformation):
#   bb.0 (OuterPreheader) -> bb.1 (SteadyTop/Prologue) -> bb.2 (SteadyInner)
#   -> bb.3 (SteadyBottom/Epilogue/Latch) -> bb.4 (PeeledIterTop)
#   -> bb.5 (PeeledIterInner) -> bb.6 (PeeledIterBottom)
#
# Slack analysis:
#   The epilogue (bb.3) has 20 bundles, the prologue (bb.1) has 12 bundles.
#   The tightest cross-boundary edge has:
#     Height=8 Depth=2 Lat=2 Slack=8
#   This is a 2-cycle latency dependency between an epilogue instruction
#   at cycle 12 from the end (Height=8 within the 20-bundle epilogue) and
#   a prologue instruction at cycle 2 (Depth=2). With 8 cycles of slack,
#   up to 8 bundles could potentially overlap. Since only 7 bundles match
#   between the prologues, the MaxMerge is min(7, 8, 8) = 7.
#
# Resource analysis:
#   checkResourceMergeability tries MergeCount=7 and finds no functional unit
#   conflicts when overlaying the first 7 prologue bundles onto the last 7
#   epilogue bundles. The check passes on the first try.
#
# Result: All 7 matching bundles are merged into the epilogue and transferred
# to the preheader.
#
# Verify the optimizer finds all 7 matching bundles.
# DBG: optimizeSiblingLoops: Processing outer loop latch
# DBG: Found 7 matching bundles
#
# Verify sufficient slack on both paths.
# DBG: Slack (Epilogue->SteadyPrologue): 8 cycles
# DBG: Slack (Epilogue->LastIterPrologue): 8 cycles
#
# Verify resource check sizes and successful merge.
# DBG: checkResourceMergeability: EpilogueSize=20 SteadyPrologueSize=12 LastPrologueIterSize=12 MaxMerge=7
# DBG: Trying MergeCount=7
# DBG: Resource mergeability check passed with 7 bundles
#
# Verify final merge result.
# DBG: Can merge 7 bundles into epilogue
# DBG: Sibling loop optimization complete: moved 7 bundles
#
# Verify the epilogue (bb.3) contains merged prologue instructions
# (VMUL and VADDMAC that were originally only in bb.1).
# MIR-LABEL: bb.3.for.cond.cleanup99:
# MIR:       VMUL_vmul_vmul_cm_core_X_X
# MIR:       VADDMAC_vaddmac_vmul_cm_core_X_X
# MIR:       VMUL_vmul_vmul_cm_core_X_X
# MIR:       VADDMAC_vaddmac_vmul_cm_core_X_X
# MIR:       VADDMAC_vaddmac_vmul_cm_core_X_X
# MIR:       ADD_NC_add_lc_ri
# MIR:       VADDMAC_vaddmac_vmul_cm_core_X_X
--- |
  
